      ],
      "text": "Website tựhọc IELTS: https://ielts-fighter.com\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        84.81104278564453,
        112.94929504394531,
        104.31244659423828
      ],
      "text": "PART 1\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        116.61104583740234,
        128.062255859375,
        136.11245727539062
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        136.71470642089844,
        512.2147216796875,
        195.23361206054688
      ],
      "text": "I’ve been meaning to ask you for some advice about restaurants. I need to\nbook somewhere to celebrate my sister’s 30th birthday, and I liked the sound\nof that place you went to for your mum’s 50th.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        208.0520477294922,
        105.86299896240234,
        227.55343627929688
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        228.1547088623047,
        508.7025451660156,
        266.87359619140625
      ],
      "text": "The Junction. Yeah, I’d definitely recommend that for a special occasion. We\nhad a great time there. Everyone really enjoyed it.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        279.6920471191406,
        128.062255859375,
        299.1934509277344
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        299.793701171875,
        281.9362487792969,
        318.5926208496094
      ],
      "text": "Where is it again? I can’t remember.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        331.4110412597656,
        105.86299896240234,
        350.9124450683594
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        351.5146789550781,
        490.01800537109375,
        370.3135986328125
      ],
      "text": "It [is] on Grayson Street only about a two [minute] walk from the station.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        383.2520446777344,
        128.062255859375,
        402.7534484863281
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        403.23468017578125,
        494.0030517578125,
        441.8336181640625
      ],
      "text": "Oh that’s good! I prefer not to have to drive anywhere but I don’t want to\nhave to walk too far either.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        454.7710266113281,
        105.86299896240234,
        474.2724304199219
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        474.87469482421875,
        523.288818359375,
        553.192626953125
      ],
      "text": "Yes, the location’s perfect, but that’s not necessarily why I’d recommend it.\nThe food’s amazing. If you like fish, it’s probably the best restaurant in town for\nthat. It’s always really fresh and there are lots of interesting dishes to choose\nfrom. But all the food is good there.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        566.1320190429688,
        128.062255859375,
        585.6334228515625
      ],
      "text": "WOMAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        75.12000274658203,
        586.2347412109375,
        196.10079956054688,
        605.0336303710938
      ],
      "text": "Is it really expensive?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        617.85205078125,
        105.86299896240234,
        637.3534545898438
      ],
      "text": "MAN:\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        72.0,
        637.834716796875,
        503.4220886230469,
        716.2736206054688
      ],
      "text": "It’s certainly not cheap, but for a special occasion I think it’s fine. It’s got a\ngreat atmosphere and before dinner you can go up on the roof and have a\ndrink. It’s really nice up there, but you need to book. It’s very popular as the\nviews are spectacular.\n"
    }
  ]
